iterations.reply:
The enrichment fetch is removed. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and the platform will not link any other import. The http-client import and fetch can be added once the graph definition actually grants that capability. Since the previous code discarded the fetch result anyway, removing it does not change the node's output.

I also made one other change: if the model's reply is not one of the three expected words, the node now escalates to a human instead of passing the question through as OK.

